<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea June precious metals import prices.</title>
<headline>S.Korea June precious metals import prices.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Import prices of South Korea's precious metals, except for gold, rose in June from May due to strong platinum group metal prices in world markets, the Association of Foreign Trading Agents of Korea said on Friday.</p>
<p>Import prices of precious metals were as follows:</p>
<p> METAL		   June	 May</p>
<p> Gold (gram)	  $11.09    $11.19</p>
<p> Silver (Kg)	 $156.77   $156.37</p>
<p> Platinum (t/oz)   $410.50   $390.92</p>
<p> Palladium (t/oz)  $182.96   $138.43</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
